  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Streetopia was a large-scale group exhibition that took place at venues throughout downtown San Francisco, May 18-23 2012. Curated by writer Erick Lyle and artists Chris Johansen and Kal Spelletich, it brought together over 50 artists, performers, writers, filmmakers, activists, thinkers, and public policy members to address the Utopian aspiration for the city. The exhibition was centered on the installation of a giant, collectively planned city to be built within the Luggage Store Gallery.</subfield>
